From: FIocker <4461558+FIocker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:35:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] rdna2spirv: the thread-group word also carries [24:20]
 and the first-wave bit (gfx1036 measurement)

@wasonidas measured the TG_SIZE_EN SGPR on gfx1036 through tools/hw_oracle (#6446): the low 12
bits matched, and the hardware also sets the wave index in [24:20] (Mesa's GFX10.3 field) and
bit 31 in the group's first wave (wave32 x 128: 80000004 00100044 00200084 003000c4). The prologue
now writes both. One pipeline-library program reads [24:20]; programs that mask with 0xfc0 or 0x3f
see the same value as before. Not measured on gfx1013.

test_cs_tg_size.py: the whole value with the new fields, and the four measured gfx1036 words.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
